  "description": "Why do you shine so brightly when you refuse to give it to me? I think I'm starting to grow greedy.Yu-Seong and Mirinae were initially set to make their debut together. But, like stars pouring down towards Mirinae, Yu-Seong became a distant person that he couldn't approach nor grasp. And without interacting as much as possible, I didn't want to be enthralled by that face.\n\n(Source: BOMTOON, translated)",
